{"unit_id": "alloevil__dsh-xray#feature-1", "repo": "alloevil/dsh-xray", "commit": "2fe86c376099a3131dee2b88d1bd52252a81c5e6", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-xray 的功能「Plugin and service overview」：面板从运行时注册表整理插件、服务和工具，并提供健康状态、依赖图及重复服务提供者视图。 通过挂载插件或对应的命令行视图使用。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/index.js:178-205"]}
